{"pin":"BH00382","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00382","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise and glory and thanksgiving and splendor befit and are worthy of that Most Desired One Who, through the motion of the Finger of Power, hath rent asunder the veils and shrouds [3.5s]... ...My God, the Object of my adoration, the Goal of my desire, the All-Bountiful, the Most Compassionate! All life is of Thee","first_line_orig":"حمد و ثنا و شکر و بها مقصودیرا لایق و سزا که بحرکت اصبع اقتدار سبحات و حجبات  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1770","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#464\"\u003eLL#464\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15690.210","source":"BLIB_Or15690","locator":"210"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15699.099b","source":"BLIB_Or15699","locator":"099b"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:084bx","source":"INBA30","locator":"084bx","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=46"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:030x","source":"INBA65","locator":"030x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=32"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA81:013bx","source":"INBA81","locator":"013bx","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v081/?page=16"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_BH_AB.025x","source":"NLAI_BH_AB","locator":"025x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NLAI.BH_AB_misc.pdf#page=25"},{"kind":"music","code":"Ahdieh","source":"Ahdieh","url":"https://ahdieh.bandcamp.com/track/--18"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.017x","source":"ADH1","locator":"017x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.326","source":"AHM","locator":"326","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-326.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.146x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"146x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-148.html"},{"kind":"public